    {
      "id": "claim_6e2e7f06ae7f4a33a04ae7f46be88040",
      "statement": "The Trusted Actions HTTP API is rooted at /api/v0/trusted-actions and defines catalog (GET /), describe (GET /{action}), run (POST /{action}/run), runs listing (GET /runs), single execution (GET /runs/{id}), execution output (GET /runs/{exec_id}/output), and audit listing (GET /audit) routes via OpenAPI path files under openapi/paths/, each $ref'd from openapi/openapi.yaml.",
