      "id": "claim_35fc445fb0954e7192e6b07d98cb56ff",
      "statement": "Catalog and describe endpoints declare security: [] in the OpenAPI spec, but the server currently applies authentication, audit-logging, and authorization middleware to the entire /api/v0/trusted-actions route group including those two routes; a TODO in cmd/server/main.go notes this mismatch is unresolved.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://components/trusted-actions/cmd/server/main.go#L374-L390",
