    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d7afb3553cfe4dfb937ff887ff5e53e7",
      "statement": "internal/ocm.Authorization.AccessReview calls the OCM SDK AccessReview (or SelfAccessReview when the caller matches the service's own connection identity) to ask AMS whether a username may perform an action on a resource type, distinct from the later per-action Kubernetes-RBAC authorization performed against the target cluster.",
